{"query":"Search for the actual April 6, 2026 court filing or docket entry by Barry Coburn in the Winston & Strawn civil suit in Washington, D.C., to obtain the primary document rather than news retellings.","results":[{"position":1,"site_name":"pcl.uscourts.gov","snippet":"For real-time case filings, search by the court where the case is filed. Use the Court CM/ECF Lookup to find the court's specific link or log into PACER and select the court name.","title":"PACER Case Locator - United States Courts","url":"http://pcl.uscourts.gov/pcl/index.jsf"},{"position":2,"site_name":"www.uscourts.gov","snippet":"Locate a federal court case by using the Public Access to Court Electronic Records (PACER) or by visiting the Clerk’s Office of the courthouse where the case was filed.","title":"Court Records - United States Courts","url":"https://www.uscourts.gov/court-records"},{"position":3,"site_name":"pacer.uscourts.gov","snippet":"Explore the various options for locating federal court case records electronically, including logging into PACER. Search for a case in the federal court where the case was filed. This information is updated immediately. Use the PACER Case Locator to search a nationwide index of federal court cases. This information is updated daily.","title":"Find a Case | PACER: Federal Court Records","url":"https://pacer.uscourts.gov/find-case"},{"position":4,"site_name":"www.courtlistener.com","snippet":"Using this archive, you can finally search and download millions of PACER documents, including those that were originally scanned PDFs, which we laboriously convert to text.","title":"Advanced RECAP Archive Search for PACER – CourtListener.com","url":"https://www.courtlistener.com/recap/"},{"position":5,"site_name":"www.uscourts.gov","snippet":"PACER allows anyone with an account to search and locate appellate, district, and bankruptcy court case and docket information. Register for a PACER account. Use the PACER Case Locator if you are not sure which specific federal court the case was filed.","title":"Find a Case (PACER) - United States Courts","url":"https://www.uscourts.gov/court-records/find-a-case-pacer"},{"position":6,"site_name":"www.courts.wa.gov","snippet":"This website is a search engine for cases filed in the municipal, district, superior, and appellate courts of the state of Washington. The search results can point you to the official or complete court record.","title":"Find Court Records | Self-Help Washington","url":"https://www.courts.wa.gov/self-help/find-court-records/"},{"position":7,"site_name":"pacer.uscourts.gov","snippet":"PACER provides information about accessing and filing federal court records electronically. Find resources for using PACER.","title":"Public Access to Court Electronic Records | PACER: Federal ...","url":"https://pacer.uscourts.gov/"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}